GCC 12.2 (Debian bookworm) miscompiles temporaries in co_await expressions: the awaitable's
captured Ref/CheckedPtr gets released one time too many. Entering fullscreen (YouTube's player)
then deleted the WebPageProxy while WebFullScreenManagerProxy::enterFullScreen still used it:
abort() in CanMakeCheckedPtrBase::crashDueToCheckedPtrToDeadObject via detachFromClient.
Keep every awaitable in a named local instead of awaiting a temporary.

